# Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# What `backend/scripts/test-env.sh` renames `.env` to while it runs, so
# pydantic cannot read it. A run that is interrupted leaves the file sitting
# there under a name the patterns above do not match — which is `.env`, with
# every production secret in it, one `git add -A` away from being committed.
.env.hidden-while-testing
*.pem

